# L §5.6 Bindings: "A bind is over an index, a kind, a key list or a stepped range"; a bind over an axis has no
# meaning: LOAD-DOMAIN at load (L §8.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

axis rd
  a "reading a"
  b "reading b"

def c: int = count(r in rd) at reader

ask q: c law 2026-06-30
